1
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,160
I'll take a few yuan's worth.

2
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,360
Two yuan's worth.

3
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:25,800
How much

4
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:26,400
per jin?

5
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,760
It's 10 yuan a jin here.

6
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,040
I'll take 10 yuan's worth.

7
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:29,570
Alright.

8
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,010
This Lu Minchuan

9
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:35,000
seems to be someone close to Zhou Yumei.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,400
Judging from their chats,

11
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,960
Lu Minchuan has always been

12
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,640
caring towards Zhou Yumei,

13
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:42,040
and he's especially good
at making her happy.

14
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,500
If that's really the case,

15
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:44,720
Lu Minchuan

16
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:47,280
likely instigated Zhou Yumei
to commit murder.

17
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:49,480
And it also explains

18
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,410
why Zhou Yumei is being so evasive.

19
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:52,360
Right.

20
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,440
We'll go do some interviews first.

21
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:56,840
When Wei and Kaixin get back,

22
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:58,840
arrange a polygraph for Zhou Yumei.

23
00:00:59,160 --> 00:00:59,490
Okay.

24
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:05,640
Wei,

25
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,520
with such a huge tragedy in her family,

26
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:13,920
it's not easy for her
to raise the kid alone.

27
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,000
At the time of the incident,

28
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,280
Xu Nianqiu was at the convenience store
downstairs with her kid.

29
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,940
Good thing they didn't see it.

30
00:01:20,039 --> 00:01:21,039
Otherwise, the kid

31
00:01:21,039 --> 00:01:23,240
would have been severely traumatized.

32
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:26,720
Your favorite tomato and egg stir-fry.

33
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:27,720
Stop doing your homework.

34
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:29,200
Clear this up and let's eat.

35
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,920
Then I'll get the rice for you, Mom.

36
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:31,880
No need.

37
00:01:32,479 --> 00:01:33,539
Just clear this up.

38
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:38,640
Wei.

39
00:01:42,479 --> 00:01:43,610
Let's go take a look.

40
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,200
Hello, Ms. Xu.

41
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:49,320
We are
from the Beitan Municipal Procuratorate.

42
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:51,080
Do you have a few minutes?

43
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,890
We just have some questions

44
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:58,160
for you.

45
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,460
Please cooperate with us.

46
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,600
I've already

47
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,530
told the police everything I know.

48
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,170
I'm still busy here.

49
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,340
Please step aside.

50
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,480
Little one,

51
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,000
what are you drawing?

52
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,280
Can I take a look?

53
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:26,660
You lived with your parents-in-law
for so long.

54
00:02:27,079 --> 00:02:28,810
How did they usually get along?

55
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:34,940
My father-in-law is dead,

56
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:37,520
and you arrested my mother-in-law.

57
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:39,520
What's the point of asking this now?

58
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,440
What exactly do you want?

59
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,880
Are you done yet?

60
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,840
Ms. Xu, you misunderstood.

61
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:51,240
He's just a child.

62
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:52,480
He knows nothing.

63
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:54,000
Why are you giving him a hard time?

64
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:54,400
I'm sorry.

65
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,440
Come at me if you have to.

66
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:57,320
Ms. Xu, that's not what we meant.

67
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:58,800
We're just here

68
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,560
to tell you something.

69
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,600
There have been some developments
in the case.

70
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,080
If you think

71
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:11,160
of any clues,

72
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:13,160
feel free to contact us anytime.

73
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,560
Are you bad guys?

74
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,810
We're the good guys.

75
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,760
We catch the bad guys.

76
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:33,140
You need to listen to your mom.

77
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:34,320
See you next time.

78
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:35,200
Bye.

79
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:36,400
Mr. Li?

80
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,220
He's an intellectual,

81
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:38,960
very educated.

82
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,960
He's just proud, thin-skinned,

83
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,940
and has quite a temper.

84
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:45,960
How was his relationship
with his wife, Zhou Yumei?

85
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,020
How should I put it?

86
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,440
Mr. Li is

87
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:49,760
a pretty good guy.

88
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,640
He just wasn't very nice to Zhou Yumei.

89
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:54,570
I live right downstairs from them.

90
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,720
I often heard

91
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,520
Mr. Li beating and scolding her.

92
00:03:58,240 --> 00:04:00,240
Did Zhou Yumei never
report this to the community

93
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,120
or the Women's Federation?

94
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,440
I guess

95
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:06,320
she just got used to it over the years.

96
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:08,360
Do you two know

97
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,160
why Li Hongkang beat Zhou Yumei?

98
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,840
There were many reasons.

99
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,640
For example, Mr. Li cares a lot
about his reputation.

100
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:14,440
He couldn't stand Zhou Yumei's habit

101
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:16,160
of picking up scrap cardboard

102
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,279
and old bottles.

103
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:28,160
I told you to stop!

104
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,840
How many times have I told you?

105
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,240
Stop picking up this junk!

106
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,440
Don't you ever learn?

107
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,800
Have I ever mistreated you
all these years?

108
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,200
Think about my position!

109
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:37,500
Aren't you ashamed

110
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,200
if others see you?

111
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:40,840
Y-Y-You're still

112
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:41,440
picking them up!

113
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:43,440
These things are still usable,

114
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:46,360
and we can sell them
to supplement our income.

115
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:48,240
Even if we just give the money
to the kids as pocket money,

116
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,170
isn't that good?

117
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:51,000
How much can you make

118
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:52,840
picking up this junk all day?

119
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:53,440
You're making a mess of the house!

120
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:54,640
They're fighting again.

121
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:55,570
Get back inside!

122
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:56,600
What are you fighting about?

123
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,640
You're family.

124
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,440
Peace makes a happy home.

125
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,200
Zhou Yumei

126
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,850
has had such a hard life.

127
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,120
Now in her old age,

128
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:05,760
she lost her son.

129
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:08,240
She has absolutely no one to rely on.

130
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:08,840
She just

131
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,560
completely fell apart.

132
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:11,600
It feels like

133
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:13,760
she's just a punching bag.

134
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,000
Well, ma'am,

135
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:16,000
have you noticed anything different

136
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,400
about Zhou Yumei lately?

137
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:19,360
She really has been

138
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,720
different lately.

139
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:21,770
I have to say,

140
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:23,420
she looks more energetic.

141
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,160
Is that so?

142
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:26,720
Since when?

143
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:29,120
I think it was
around the beginning of the year.

144
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,440
What about her and her daughter-in-law?

145
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,480
How is their relationship?

146
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,200
It's fine.

147
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:33,980
I feel like they've

148
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,650
never... never had a fight.

149
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,080
Ma'am,

150
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:38,520
have you ever heard

151
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:41,200
Zhou Yumei say anything
about leaving Li Hongkang?

152
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:42,730
You mean getting a divorce?

153
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,170
That's impossible.

154
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,400
At their age,

155
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,530
they won't divorce.

156
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:48,840
In the past,

157
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:50,440
Mr. Li had the chance

158
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,000
to return to the city early.

159
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:52,560
Zhou Yumei

160
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,420
threw a tantrum

161
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,480
and wouldn't let him come back.

162
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,200
These two

163
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:58,000
were never meant for each other.

164
00:05:58,320 --> 00:06:00,360
Forcing themselves to live together,

165
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:02,090
how could they have a good life?

166
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:05,800
Zhou Yumei hasn't been getting along
with Li all these years.

167
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:08,800
Maybe she's wanted to kill Li Hongkang
for a long time.

168
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:12,440
I'm telling you,
none of you men are any good.

169
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:16,000
Do you know how hard it is
for us women in this life?

170
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,330
Look at what you're saying.

171
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,600
I think men and women

172
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:20,530
are the same.

173
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,400
Life

174
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:22,660
is not easy for anyone.

175
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,130
Let's not

176
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:25,440
argue about this.

177
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:27,520
Let me ask you,

178
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:30,800
is Zhou Yumei going to get
the death penalty this time?

179
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:32,480
Everyone,

180
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:34,400
the verdict hasn't been announced yet.

181
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:35,880
Let's not jump to conclusions.

182
00:06:35,880 --> 00:06:36,610
If you ask me,

183
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,440
Zhou Yumei

184
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,400
has had this idea for a long time.

185
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,760
Swallowing her pride for so many years,

186
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:42,960
it's all bitterness.

187
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,440
That's exactly how it is.

188
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:47,480
She's suffered so much grievance
at home all these years.

189
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,840
I think being in prison

190
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,720
is better than being bullied at home.

191
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,360
Sir,

192
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:52,800
we shouldn't rely on hearsay

193
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,120
for these things.

194
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,930
We still need to respect objective facts.

195
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,440
Wei,

196
00:06:59,159 --> 00:07:01,080
Xu Nianqiu obviously
misunderstood me just now.

197
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:02,740
Why didn't you let me explain?

198
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,160
Feeling wronged?

199
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,680
That's just how work is.

200
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:11,010
Try to put yourself in Xu Nianqiu's shoes.

201
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:13,770
Protecting her child
is a mother's instinct.

202
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,900
But our case has already
reached this stage.

203
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:19,040
Isn't it the clients' obligation

204
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,960
to cooperate with our investigation?

205
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,490
Even with that obligation,

206
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,640
it doesn't mean

207
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:26,040
they have to cooperate with us completely.

208
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,640
Since today doesn't work,

209
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:29,160
we'll just come back another day.

210
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,680
We'll figure something out.

211
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,160
Okay.

212
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,320
You're back.

213
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:37,500
Weiwei.

214
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,640
Kaixin, you head back first.

215
00:07:49,159 --> 00:07:50,960
You must be Weiwei's colleague.

216
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:53,159
Such a petite and cute girl.

217
00:07:53,159 --> 00:07:53,880
So pretty.

218
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:54,880
I'm Weiwei's mom.

219
00:07:55,159 --> 00:07:56,680
I came especially to see her.

220
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,440
Hello.

221
00:07:58,640 --> 00:08:00,040
Let me treat you to a meal.

222
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:00,840
Sure.

223
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:02,280
We haven't eaten yet anyway.

224
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:02,920
Kaixin.

225
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,560
We have work later.

226
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,280
We'll pass.

227
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:11,050
Yeah, ma'am,

228
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:13,560
we still have work to do.

229
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,480
Weiwei,

230
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,360
you're off the clock.

231
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,420
What work is there?

232
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:17,520
Exactly.

233
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,520
I've been in Beitan for days,

234
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:21,520
and you haven't had time to visit me.

235
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,080
Just have a meal with me.

236
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:23,840
Let's go get a bite,

237
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:24,360
okay?

238
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,820
I don't have much time.

239
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:28,760
A meal is fine,

240
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,690
but save the extra talk.

241
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:31,900
Alright, alright.

242
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,360
A meal won't take long.

243
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:33,890
Let's go,

244
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:34,720
girl.

245
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:35,250
Let's go.

246
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:35,600
Okay.

247
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:36,120
Coming.

248
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:40,280
Here's

249
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:41,130
the milk tea.

250
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,340
You bought this for me?

251
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:45,760
Too bad I quit.

252
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:48,570
I drink this now.

253
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,450
What's this?

254
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:50,040
Hot tea.

255
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,520
I thought you loved sweets.

256
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:55,360
You used to order them
for us all the time,

257
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,490
but now you've quit.

258
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,960
Young people drink milk tea.

259
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:58,960
When you get older,

260
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,360
you have to drink hot tea.

261
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:01,360
All right.

262
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,520
Give it to Kaixin.

263
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:04,370
Okay.

264
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:08,040
Did you find Lu Minchuan?

265
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:09,160
Found him.

266
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:12,090
But he's currently traveling out of town.

267
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,600
The police have notified him

268
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,460
to return to Beitan immediately.

269
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:22,940
Let's call it a day.

270
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,280
I have something to take care of.

271
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:25,920
I'll be

272
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:27,360
leaving then.

273
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:28,120
You can go.

274
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,770
Thanks, Yishan.

275
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:44,320
Weiwei,

276
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,320
don't be polite with me today.

277
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:48,920
Order whatever you want.

278
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:49,720
Pick the expensive dishes.

279
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:50,480
All right?

280
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,700
I've got money.

281
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,960
Your uncle is rarely this generous.

282
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,040
Just do it for me

283
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,120
and have

284
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,160
a few bites.

285
00:09:59,160 --> 00:09:59,840
Exactly.

286
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,280
I know

287
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,480
you still hold a grudge against me.

288
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:05,760
But food is food.

289
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:07,210
Don't starve yourself.

290
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,250
You must be tired

291
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:09,740
after working all day.

292
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:11,920
Wei,

293
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:14,180
why don't we just have a few bites?

294
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:18,320
All these dishes look pretty good.

295
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:18,840
Yeah.

296
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,440
Just a few bites.

297
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,040
Have some.

298
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:34,920
Come on, kid.

299
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:37,480
That's right.

300
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,040
Let me tell you something.

301
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:41,040
I've been making good money lately.

302
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:43,160
Your job seems pretty tough.

303
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,440
Why don't you quit being a prosecutor

304
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:46,370
and work with me?

305
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:48,520
I guarantee you a comfortable life.

306
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:49,160
Exactly.

307
00:10:49,160 --> 00:10:50,820
Your uncle is doing great now.

308
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,880
You're not getting any younger.

309
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:54,640
Let him introduce you to a good guy.

310
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:55,640
Just get married.

311
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,420
It would give me peace of mind.

312
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,020
This kid...

313
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:04,280
Why are you getting so worked up?

314
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:06,560
We're just doing this for your own good.

315
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:08,000
Kaixin.

316
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:08,850
Let's go.

317
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,300
Weiwei.

318
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,360
Don't go.

319
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:11,920
Well...

320
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:13,360
We'll stop talking about it.

321
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,560
Let's just eat, okay?

322
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:15,210
Move.

323
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,930
Why are you being so unreasonable?

324
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:20,160
Your uncle kindly invited you to dinner.

325
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,090
He's your elder.

326
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,020
What more do you want from him?

327
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:25,580
I don't need him to do anything for me.

328
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:30,770
Just don't show up in front of me again.

329
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:39,120
Ma'am,

330
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,960
our boss just told us to work overtime.

331
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,290
I have to take them back.

332
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:43,120
Right, right,

333
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:44,520
we have to work overtime.

334
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:45,970
Let's go.

335
00:11:46,160 --> 00:11:47,090
Goodbye, ma'am.

336
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:25,200
I want to tell you something.

337
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:26,360
What is it?

338
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:26,890
Go ahead.

339
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:31,500
My uncle took me out this time.

340
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:33,720
He lost me.

341
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:35,400
I know about this.

342
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:36,860
Your uncle told me.

343
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:39,000
But nothing happened, right?

344
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,600
He said he found you quickly.

345
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:42,660
Don't take it to heart.

346
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,840
I scolded your uncle too.

347
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:49,400
He's always so careless.

348
00:12:50,400 --> 00:12:51,240
He meant well.

349
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:53,900
He just wanted to take you out for fun.

350
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:56,040
Your uncle treats you very well.

351
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,840
He always thinks of you
when there's something good.

352
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,080
Don't be mad at him.

353
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:01,250
Think about his good sides.

354
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,040
Go, go, go!

355
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:10,600
Zhou Yan, go!

356
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,640
What are you doing there?

357
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:12,600
I'm here.

358
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:13,720
Ah, I'm here.

359
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,960
I'm thirsty from talking to you.

360
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,760
Go, go!

361
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:21,440
Coming, coming!

362
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:23,240
Why are you always hiding in the back?

363
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:23,920
Don't rush.

364
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:26,560
Let's go together. Start a team fight.

365
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:27,120
Who is it?

366
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:27,960
At this hour.

367
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:32,440
Yishan!

368
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,370
Why are you here?

369
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,370
I came to see Wei.

370
00:13:35,800 --> 00:13:37,200
Why aren't you asleep yet?

371
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,440
Doing homework.

372
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,000
Where are you?

373
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,840
I'm fighting hard here.

374
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:42,920
Why did you bail?

375
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:48,960
Sometimes you just need a break.

376
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:50,040
Just have fun.

377
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:51,300
We're off work anyway.

378
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:52,120
Yishan,

379
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,180
please have a seat.

380
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:54,160
What do you want to drink?

381
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:54,920
Cold or hot?

382
00:13:55,160 --> 00:13:56,200
Juice or water?

383
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:57,440
Don't bother.

384
00:13:58,640 --> 00:14:00,440
I'll get you some hot water then.

385
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:08,620
Thanks.

386
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,400
Is Wei's relationship

387
00:14:18,400 --> 00:14:21,200
with her mom and uncle a bit weird?

388
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:23,130
You noticed?

389
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:24,520
I'm not an idiot.

390
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:25,650
Of course I noticed.

391
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:27,800
Wei's

392
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:30,280
family situation is a bit complicated.

393
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:32,520
Her parents separated
when she was very young.

394
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:34,400
She grew up with her mom and uncle.

395
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:37,400
So what's the conflict between them?

396
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,560
That's a knot in Wei's heart

397
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:40,490
that hasn't been untied for years.

398
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:42,800
If she doesn't bring it up, don't ask.

399
00:14:42,800 --> 00:14:44,130
I definitely won't ask.

400
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,160
She's so cold,

401
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:46,820
I'd rather stay away from her.

402
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:48,720
Am I that cold?

403
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,450
Do I scare you that much?

404
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:55,000
She seems cold,

405
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,000
but she's actually warm-hearted.

406
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,800
You'll see as you get to know her.

407
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:59,640
Wei, I was just joking.

408
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,000
You're here.

409
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,330
What about Chengcheng?

410
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:05,340
Chengcheng is asleep.

411
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:06,600
I came to check on you.

412
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:07,850
I'm fine.

413
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,480
Yishan just

414
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,800
cares about you.

415
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:15,320
Actually,

416
00:15:15,800 --> 00:15:17,920
if you're unhappy about something,

417
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:19,200
you can just say it.

418
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,720
If you tell us,

419
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:22,000
we can talk about it together.

420
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:24,200
Maybe we can even help you figure it out.

421
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:26,200
Nothing much.

422
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:27,860
Come here, son.

423
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:30,040
The park is beautiful, isn't it?

424
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:31,320
Weiwei.

425
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:33,250
Your uncle treats you best, right?

426
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:33,840
Look at

427
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:35,700
these tall buildings.

428
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:37,360
Big cities are just different,

429
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,090
aren't they?

430
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,600
When we have money,

431
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,720
can we move here?

432
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:41,520
No problem.

433
00:15:41,800 --> 00:15:42,800
When I have money,

434
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:43,920
I'll bring our whole family

435
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,240
to live in the city.

436
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:46,650
How does that sound?

437
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:47,280
Good?

438
00:15:47,640 --> 00:15:49,000
I'll bring everyone over, okay?

439
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:50,460
We'll all live in the city.

440
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,120
Is that okay, Weiwei?

441
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,800
Home is still more comfortable.

442
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:56,160
Take a photo.

443
00:15:56,160 --> 00:15:57,760
Take a photo for memory.

444
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:59,280
Family photos,

445
00:15:59,280 --> 00:16:00,400
20 a piece.

446
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:01,160
Ready in a minute.

447
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,520
There's a photo booth over there.

448
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:03,200
After taking the photos,

449
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:03,920
I can show them

450
00:16:03,920 --> 00:16:04,880
to my aunt

451
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:06,400
and classmates.

452
00:16:06,640 --> 00:16:07,300
Twenty yuan

453
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:09,170
can buy a good bottle of liquor.

454
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:11,000
Son, how about

455
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:11,960
we take photos

456
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:12,720
back in town?

457
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:14,640
We can take as many as we want there.

458
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:16,600
The owner of the photo studio
in town is my friend.

459
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,120
Why do you want to take photos here?

460
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:18,920
Taking photos.

461
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:19,600
Be a good boy.

462
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:20,680
Let's go.

463
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:22,600
Are these two your kids?

464
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:23,840
Yes.

465
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,120
You look so pretty.

466
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:26,240
This is my son,

467
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:27,370
and this is my niece.

468
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:28,520
Are the kids

469
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:29,520
a bit hungry?

470
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:30,200
Take it.

471
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:30,640
No, no, no.

472
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:31,200
Just take it.

473
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:32,320
Eat it.

474
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:33,320
You're so greedy.

475
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:34,330
Come on, take it.

476
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:35,720
Say thank you to the lady.

477
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:36,720
Thank you, ma'am.

478
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:38,120
The little girl is pretty.

479
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:40,360
Could we ask the kids to be our models?

480
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:43,520
Look at the little models
in this magazine.

481
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:44,720
We took these photos.

482
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:46,480
They are beautifully taken.

483
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:49,360
Can our kids be models?

484
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:50,600
No problem.

485
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:52,120
Of course.

486
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:53,880
We are all photographers.

487
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:55,440
Being a model actually pays.

488
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:56,080
Really?

489
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:56,760
One hundred an hour.

490
00:16:56,760 --> 00:16:57,090
Here,

491
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,600
let me pay you first.

492
00:16:58,600 --> 00:17:00,720
Take it, take it.

493
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:02,000
Getting paid already?

494
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:02,400
Dad,

495
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:03,520
if we do this modeling thing,

496
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:04,880
can we move here?

497
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:05,560
Yeah.

498
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:06,319
Once we have money,

499
00:17:06,319 --> 00:17:06,720
we can all

500
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:07,880
move to the city,

501
00:17:08,079 --> 00:17:08,880
right?

502
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:09,400
We'll do it.

503
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:11,200
Uncle, I don't want to take photos.

504
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:12,920
Look, they even paid us upfront.

505
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:14,720
Look, taking photos makes money, right?

506
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,050
You can be a little star.

507
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:17,920
Come here, little girl.

508
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:19,119
Come on.

509
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:19,839
Excuse me,

510
00:17:19,839 --> 00:17:20,119
sir.

511
00:17:20,119 --> 00:17:22,880
There's a newly opened amusement park
right over there.

512
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:24,720
They have bumper cars

513
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:26,040
and air guns.

514
00:17:26,040 --> 00:17:27,000
It's all free.

515
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:27,680
Things little boys love,

516
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:28,880
and they're all free.

517
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:30,520
I want to go.

518
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:31,960
Don't rush.

519
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:32,920
She's taking photos.

520
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:33,640
You go ahead.

521
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:34,080
Don't worry,

522
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:35,120
I'll watch her for you.

523
00:17:35,120 --> 00:17:35,840
Hurry up! I want to play.

524
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:37,080
The photos will be done soon.

525
00:17:37,080 --> 00:17:37,400
You go ahead.

526
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:37,720
Okay, okay.

527
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:38,400
I'll take him to play for a bit.

528
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:39,680
Go ahead. Don't worry at all.

529
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:40,480
I'll leave her to you.
Take a few more photos.

530
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:41,200
Okay, okay.

531
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,080
No problem.

532
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:42,560
Go ahead.

533
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:43,090
Let's go.

534
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:43,970
Okay.

535
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:44,400
Rest assured.

536
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:45,080
We're going then.

537
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:46,410
Keep an eye on her for me.

538
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:50,080
Look at me.

539
00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:50,960
Miss,

540
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:52,080
come here.

541
00:17:52,080 --> 00:17:52,520
Take off your bag.

542
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:54,120
It's heavy.

543
00:17:54,120 --> 00:17:54,840
Come on.

544
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:56,720
So pretty.

545
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:57,720
You really

546
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:58,600
look like a big star.

547
00:17:58,600 --> 00:18:00,000
She does look like a star.

548
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:00,980
Okay, okay.

549
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:02,560
Smile.

550
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:03,760
So beautiful.

551
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:12,330
Is it fun?

552
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:13,850
It's really fun.

553
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:16,850
Where did

554
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:17,840
they go?

555
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:18,170
Where

556
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:20,060
did they go?

557
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:22,760
Sir,

558
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:25,280
did you see a kid
taking photos here just now?

559
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:26,010
No, I didn't.

560
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:27,920
Where did they go?

561
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,720
It was that serious?

562
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:32,760
Did you get hurt?

563
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,240
It wasn't that bad.

564
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:37,280
I'm doing fine now, aren't I?

565
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:39,480
I was sold to a village,

566
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,290
but I managed to escape.

567
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:42,120
Then,

568
00:18:42,120 --> 00:18:43,920
I ran into Yishan and the others.

569
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:48,040
Fortunately, Wei was smart

570
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:49,500
and remembered the route.

571
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:52,440
I was a prosecutor's assistant back then,

572
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:54,640
doing an exchange
at the police department.

573
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:56,040
It was my first case.

574
00:18:59,800 --> 00:19:01,730
Then your mom should know about it.

575
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:03,090
Why would she...

576
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:04,330
Of course she knows.

577
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:06,080
I can't understand

578
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:07,920
her indifference.

579
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:10,340
She even defends my uncle.

580
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,500
Your mom doesn't care,

581
00:19:14,080 --> 00:19:15,410
but mine cares too much.

582
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:17,560
She even dictates my work.

583
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:22,840
I know you've long moved on
from that incident.

584
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:24,440
What you can't let go of

585
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,770
is your mom's attitude.

586
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:29,800
It's okay.

587
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:31,000
You won't be alone anymore.

588
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:31,520
Come on,

589
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:33,200
give me a hug.

590
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,760
We'll always be here for you.

591
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:39,760
Don't get stuck in the past.

592
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:41,000
Life has so many possibilities.

593
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:41,960
Exactly.
